<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">- Miwera</book>
  <para style="h">LUTA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lut</para>
  <para style="toc2">LUTA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buku e Luta</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buku e LUTA</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luta</para>
  <para style="imt">Bokwea ta buku</para>
  <para style="ip">Isolo di Luta di losɔmbedjakadea ta ehole e ba djudji ta mondumba mobabeaka ibo ko badaledjaka bato ba Isalɛlɛ, endelo isolo dimina ikɛkɛdea ahule akomama iya ngɔngɔ, ta busa bomɔti bobwani bodaa pɛpɛ bodjebama mɛnɛ bopele. Tina e buku etubanakadea isolo dimina edii ta boinedja mondumba mokwea na mwali omɔti o mokɛndɛli ta tei e bato ba Ndjakomba. Ta tina emina isolo dinedjakadea na bonɔ Luta moto o Moabi, iyona odii embete e bosapa na ibota di muma nde ko na Ndjakomba o Isalɛlɛ. Buku einedjakadea mondumba bosapa bo Luta bomobotea tɛtɛ: ta tei e ndjokwa enɛnɛ edaka na bu, Luta na bokio bo nde o mwali Naomi boso ba baimeaka na bodieli bonɛnɛ ko na ekumu. Buku ekomama na modumba mo bogɔmbedja milema mi bato, einedjakadea embete e bodhimeana ta tei e bato ko na boisa molema ta dii Ndjakomba. Bobotama bo mwana moomi o Luta bodii modjɔ mo peli buku eye: modjɔ mo mwana omina aimeadea kɔkɔ e mokondji Dapiti. Ta tina emina iyena, ta motangi mo bakɔkɔ ba Dapiti, Luta moto o Moabi adii pongono na polo e nde ta tei e bakɔkɔ ba Yesu (Mat 1.5).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ndjokwa ta ibota di Elimɛlɛkɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />Ta ehole edaaka ba djudji badaledja Isalɛlɛ, ndja eso ekwa ta ekomi. Iboa moomi omɔti o Bɛtɛlɛmɛ e Yudha akɛɛ na mwali o nde ko na bana ba nde baami babae; adaa moo ehole mokɛkɛ ta ekomi e Moabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta ehole edaledjaka ba djudji Isalɛlɛ: epalakadea bobala mbuti na yanga 1100 boso bo Yesu Kilito, boindja ta buku e ba Djudji. Moabi: esika ebatatake e kona ekadae ta dɔngɔ dikaimane modakabusa e dua e Monana.</char></note>. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Kombe e moomi omina Elimɛlɛkɛ, mwali o nde Naomi ko bana ba nde baami: Mahalɔni na Kiliɔni; badaaka bato ba ibota di Epalata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Efalata: edii mosa momɔti mo ngando modaka ta Yudha ta tei e Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, ngando ekadae ta ndambo e bakolomɛtɛlɛ ta dɔngɔ di sadiko di Yelusalɛmɛ.</char></note> iho ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ e Yudha. Ta ehole edaaka ibo ta ekomi e Moabi, <verse eid="RUT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Elimɛlɛkɛ agwa ko Naomi adika iyo mɛnɛ na bana ba nde baami babae. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Bana ibia baasɔ bali ba ekomi e Moabi; omɔti kombe e nde Olɔpa, okina Luta. Bayeyoa iho bokimana bianga doomi, <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />Mahalɔni na Kiliɔni baso bagwa pongono. Naomi adika iyo mɛnɛ pɛpɛ mwana ko pɛpɛ moomi.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luta ayani na Naomi ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Iboa Naomi aoka bo Ta ekomi e Moabi Kumu akɔmedji bato ba nde ko abapa leka loboyaka. Asɛlingoa adonge ta ekomi iyena engbanga emɔti na bakio ba nde babae. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Akina esika ehelamaka iyo akɛɛ engbanga na bakio bande babae bɛngi bayane ta ekomi e Yudha, endelo na ndjea, <verse eid="RUT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />iboa Naomi abatɔndea bo: «Moto na moto ayane ta dii nange ende. Kina bo Kumu aokɔmeeni bopele mondumba mokɔmea ino mbi mɛnɛ kona ibia bagwa! <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Kina bo Kumu akamoe engi moto abolodje moki ko aokɔmeeni bopele ta ndako dji bono!» Ngɔngɔ djimina abadinga ekɔpi bɛngi babɔtɔe, endelo ibo baso bayea bobuke mɛnɛ <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />ko babala na nde bo: «Ngasa! Lokɛkɛdea na wɛ engbanga emɔti tee mbunoko ta dii bato ba wɛ!» <verse eid="RUT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Naomi abasɔmbedja bo: «Yanani ta dii ino, bana ba mbi ba bali. Tina ekimanakadeani na nu nda? Nabwaniti bobota naikina bana baami bɛngi baosɔeni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ehole egwi moto pɛpɛ mwana, mwa nango o moomi kaoko moto edii na nde bwela bo itina, atungi boasɔ mwali o bogwa bɛngi abanee ibota di mowei. Iyena edii kokɔkɔ bokabee ibo «levila», boindja Dit 25, 5-10; Mba 38, 6-8; Mat 22, 24.</char></note>. <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Yanani bana ba mba. Mbi naimei mosuku nabwaniti bokɛɛ naikina ta moki. Ko nakaisa molema bo nabwani nakɛe moki: “Oko ta bulu bo busa ibubu nadiadea moomi ko nabotadea bana baami”, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />Otukeadeani tee bakandoe? Olonadeani boasɔnɔ na baami bakina? Ngasa, bana ba mbi bali! Nadii na ndjokwa enɛnɛ bonɔ e bino, modjɔ mo ebɔ e Kumu eokedjini saya mɛnɛ.»<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Bakio babae baso bayea naikina bobuke mɛnɛ. Ngɔngɔ djimina Olɔpa adinga bokio bo nde ekɔpi aso amoisea ndese e suka, endelo Luta alona bobɔtɔ na Naomi. <verse eid="RUT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Iboa Naomi abala na Luta bo: «Indja mbanda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbanda etingodji iya bo: Olɔpa na Luta baidaka na moomi omɔti basɔnɔkɔ na bana baami ba Naomi babae.</char></note> e wɛ ayani ta dii bato bande ko ta dii ba ndjakomba ba nde, wɛ pongono yana oko mondumba mosayana iyo.»<verse eid="RUT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Luta asɔmbedja bo: «Kina bolindoanani nayane ko kina bosiani nakaokimana. Esika esusu ekɛedea wɛ, mbi nakɛɛdea; esika edaadea wɛ, mbi nadadea ena. Bato ba wɛ badaadea bato ba mbi; Ndjaokomba o wɛ adadea Ndjakomba o mbi. <verse eid="RUT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Esika egwadea wɛ mbi nagwadea ko napuseamadea oko ena. Kina bo Kumu apɛni etumbu enɔi na bobuke emiti daa oko yogo elobɔtodje!» <verse eid="RUT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Ehole eɛnɛ Naomi bo Luta akpekpea bo akɛe na nde engbanga emɔti, akina bomolindoana <verse eid="RUT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />ko bakɛɛ engbanga emɔti mbunoko ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ. Boimea bo bobo ngando enɛnɛ esusu eso ekumana. Bali baso bawadjaka bo: «Iyoo edii oko Naomi?» <verse eid="RUT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Naomi abasɔmbedja bo: « Pɛpɛ bobeanini Naomi, “Mwali o mongandi”, endelo beanini Mala “Mwali o ndjokwa”, modjɔ mo Kumu Onɔi Ngulu aokedjini ndjokwa enɛnɛ. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Nakinaka iya moto mokokake ko Kumu ahuledjini mɔmɔ ngasa. Pɛpɛ bobeanini Naomi elɔkɔe bo Kumu ahombani diko di mbi ko Kumu onɔi ngulu aɛnɛdjini ndjokwa enɛnɛ.» <verse eid="RUT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Iyena edii mondumba mohula Naomi ta Moabi na bokiyo bo nde Luta, moto o Moabi. Baimea ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ ta ehole ebukaka bo mbuma dji olɔdje<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Batswaka ɔlɔdje ta songe o banei na o batano.</char></note>.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Luta asakani na Boadji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Moto omɔti modieli ko o gala adaaka ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ kombe e nde Boadji. Iyo adaaka bwela bo Elimɛlɛkɛ moomi o Naomi. <verse eid="RUT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Busa bomɔti, Luta moto o Moabi abala na Naomi bo: «Pani ndjea, nakɛe ta gbie andoana mbuma djia ikwakadea ta ngɔngɔ dji bato ibia babukakadea. Kaoko nabwani bodia moto obookeani wa bɛngi nandoane.» Naomi amosɔmbedja bo: «Nongo kɛe mwana o mba.» <verse eid="RUT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Luta akɛɛ adoana mbuma ta gbie, ngɔngɔ dji bato ibia bandoanaka. Enakoboa esongana bo gbie emina edaka e Boadji, bwela bo Elimɛlɛkɛ. <verse eid="RUT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Oko ta ehole emina, Boadji aimea ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ. Aisea bato babukaka mbuma dji ble bo: «Kina bo Kumu adae na nu!» Bamosɔmbedja bo: « Kina bo Kumu aodjongoe!» <verse eid="RUT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Boadji awadja kapita o bato batswaka mbuma dji ble bo: «Moseka iyo adii mwali o nda?» <verse eid="RUT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Kapita amosɔmbedja bo: «Adii mwana mwali o Moabi, ahulabi engbanga emɔti na Naomi. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Awadjakini ndjea andoe mbuma ngɔngɔ dji bato batswakadea mihɔngbu mi mbuma dji ble. Adoaki ehuma e busa ibubu mbunoko edɛdiyeye ahemaki oko moo ehole mokɛkɛ.» <verse eid="RUT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Iboa Boadji abala na Luta bo: «Hokamedja bopele mwana mwali o mba. Pɛpɛ bokɛɛ oko andoana mbuma ta gbie e moto okina; dikama iya ko sala engbanga emɔti na basali ba mbi ba bali. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Indja bopele pamba e bukakadea bo mbuma ta gbie ko kimana bali ibia babukakadea. Nasii basali badae pɛpɛ bookumana. Ehole eokadea wɛ posa e madiba kɛɛ amwake imia maloki basali ta mondungulu.» <verse eid="RUT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Iboa Luta akwa na magbunda ko aso asunea boso ta kpɔtɔ ko abala na Boadji bo: «Ookeini ndjokwa enɛnɛ ibo tina nda ko okɔmedji mbi iyona odii mokɛndɛli?» <verse eid="RUT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Boadji amosɔmbedja bo: «Batubanini midjɔ misusu mikɔɔbi wɛ bokiyo bo wɛ o mwali ngɔngɔ dji bogwa bo moomi o wɛ. Nadjebakadea mondumba mokini wɛ sangwao, na ngwao ko na ekomi ebotama wɛ bɛngi odoe ahelama na bato badaka wɛ pɛpɛ bodjeba. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Yɛɛ bo Kumu aopute na midjɔ imia misusu mikɔɔbi wɛ. Yɛɛ bo Kumu, Ndjakomba o Isalɛlɛ aopute na bonɔ modjɔ mo odoi abolama nase dji mapapu ma nde.» <verse eid="RUT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Luta asɔmbedja bo: «Moswa mbi, okɔmeini bopele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okɔmeini bopele: ta mohombedja mokina daa mopele ta tina e mba!</char></note>! Opini mokuku ngulu na mibalo mi wɛ mi bwela, abo nabwaniti nongo na mosali mwali omɔti o wɛ.»<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Ta ehole e boyaka mia, Boadji abala na Luta bo: «Doa loyake; tomba ipa ko dubea ta mosua.» Luta adaa polo emɔti na bato ba mosala ko Boadji amopa mbuma djikalangake. Luta ayaka agola ndambo ekina eso edika. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, asɔmbɔ ta gbie andoana mihɔngbu mi mbuma, Boadji apa mitindo ta dii basali bo: «Mokinani andoane mbuma na nongo ta esika eemedji no maboke ma olɔdje na pɛpɛ bomobangedja<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta mondumba mopele bokondji bo boandoana bodaka oko ehole esidjaka baoneli mosala mo bobo ko bakadongedja kata dji mbuma. </char></note>. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Obwanini kutu bodumba ndambo e mbuma idjia djinangakadea ino ta kpɔtɔ bɛngi adjiandoe. Pɛpɛ bomekani bomoanoanedja.» <verse eid="RUT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Luta andoana mbuma ta gbie mbunoko mɔmɔkɔ, ngɔngɔ djimina adjibomakaka edikaka mweka djimee saki emɔti enɛnɛ e mbuma dji ɔlɔdje<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tɔmbi emɔti enɛnɛ e ɔlɔdje: edii wɛtoko kilo tuku djisato.</char></note>.<verse eid="RUT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Atombi saki na ndambo e mia mayakaka ibo ayana ta ngando enɛnɛ ko aso apa bokiyo bo nde. <verse eid="RUT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Naomi amowadja bo: «Andoani wɛ mbuma idji busa ibubu djɔ? Osalaki ta gbie e nda? Yɛɛ bo moto iyo o opi ekumu adjongoame.» Iboa Luta atɔndea bokiyo bo nde bo asalaka ta bgie e moto omɔti kombe e nde Boadji. <verse eid="RUT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Naomi abala bo: «Moto omina adjongoame na Kumu iyona okadae pɛpɛ bokina boinedja bopele bo nde ta dii bato badii na bomɔ na ibia bagwa!» Naomi abala naikina bo: «Moto omina adii bwela bo biso, adii omɔti ta tei e bato babwani bolosikoa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boidje adaka ta ibota di Elimɛlɛkɛ (boindja ta 2, 1). Moto o bwela bo itina o mowei odaka na bokondji bɛngi asikoe mopkɔtɔ mo Elimɛlɛkɛ ko amobanee ta tei e ibota, boindja 4, 1, 8; Yil 32, 7-9. Ta tina e modjɔ momina abwanaka bosuma mobeko mo levila, Boindja 1, 11 ko na nase, 3, 9 ko 4, 5.14.</char></note>.» <verse eid="RUT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Iboa Luta moto o Moabi asɔmbedja bo: «Atɔndeini nasale esika emɔti na basali ba nde tee mbunoko ehole esiadea gbie esusu bobuka mbuma.» <verse eid="RUT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Naomi asɔmbedja na bokiyo bo nde Luta bo: «Mwana o mba edii bopele, kimana oko na basali ba nde ba bali. Pɛpɛ bomeka bokɛɛ ta gbie e moto okina basaka kɛɛ aonɔngedja iho.» <verse eid="RUT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Iboa Luta abuka mbuma esika emɔti na basali ba bali ba Boadji mbunoko ehole esia mbuma dji ɔlɔdje na mbuma dji ble. Adikamaka oko ta dii bokiyo bo nde.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Luta asɛngɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Busa bomɔti, Naomi bokiyo bo Luta abala na nde bo: «Mwana o mba, etungi na mbi naohombee esika epele ebwani na wɛ bodaa bopele. <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Odjebakadea Boadji, iyona asalaka wɛ engbanga emɔti na basali ba nde ba bali adii bwela bo biso. Enakoboa busa ibubu mɔmɔkɔ, akɛɛdea abomakaka mbuma dji olɔdje ta diako di nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diako: edii polo ekɛkɛ ibo abomakaka mbuma ondingo ble bɛngi babotodje na kekele. </char></note>. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Iboa sasosa, sasopea malasi ko lwoa mokoto mowɛ mopele kɛɛ iho ta diako di nde, endelo pɛpɛ bosaɛnɛmedja oko boso bo nde ehole edii iyo pɛpɛ bosidja boya ko na bomwaka. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Ehole emadea iyo sama, toma indja polo esamadea iyo. Sabatea mbuti ko kundoa molangiti mo nde ko saama ta mako ma nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Modjɔ momina mobwani na iwadja di bobaneama bo Luta, boindja molɔngɔ mo 9. Ebwani bodaa mɛnɛ kutu na bonɔ ilɛno di moki, kombe djibalama na monɔkɔ mo ebele ekadae monduma miindji boɛngɛbɛnɛ bodaa bo mwali na moomi.</char></note>. Ngɔngɔ djimina iyo mɛnɛ ainedjadea eka ebwani na wɛ bokɔɔ.» <verse eid="RUT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Luta asɔmbedja bo: «Nakɔɔdɛa midjɔ misusu misa bala wɛ.» <verse eid="RUT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Luta akɛɛ ta diako ko akɔɔ oko motindo moma motɔndea bokiyo bo nde. <verse eid="RUT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Boadji ayaka mia ko amwaka, molema mo nde moso moluma na mongandi, akɛɛ asama mbuti na iboke di nde di mbuma dji olɔdje<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boadji asamaka ta mokpengɔ mo epkongbolo e nde e mbuma bɛngi aɛsɛndjɛle na bulu.</char></note>. Luta akɛɛ bopɛtɛ bopɛtɛ, akundoa molangiti mo nde ko asaninodja ta mako ma nde. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Ta ndanda e bulu, Boadji adjakimi ta tei e hiɔ ko asangɔdjɔ ko aɛnɛ mwali asambi ta mako ma nde. <verse eid="RUT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Amowadja bo: «Wɛ nda?» Amosɔmbedja bo: «Edii mbi Luta, mosali o wɛ. Kundani sɔngɔ e esendja e wɛ modjɔ mo odii omɔti ta tei e bato bawani bosikoani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mosala mo moto odii ta bwela bo itina: boindja ta 2, 20 ko na nase. Kundani sɔngɔ e esendja e wɛ: edii embete e ebanea ko e moki. Boɛngɛ 2, 21; Edj 16, 8 ko na nase.</char></note>.» <verse eid="RUT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Boadji amotɔndea bo: «Mwana o mbi o mwali, yɛɛ bo Kumu aodjongoe! Oinedji bwela ta ibota di moomi o wɛ, bonɔɔ ibua boinedja wɛ ta dii bokiyo bo wɛ. Modjɔ mo obwanaki bohomba Menga ibia badii na madieli kaoko bakwali. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Edɛdiyeye, mwana o mba o mwali, pɛpɛ bobanga oko. Ekɔmɔɔdea eka esusu ewadjadeani wɛ, modjɔ mo moto mosusu iyaya ta dii iso adjebakadea bo odii mwali omɔti o ekumu. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />Edii oko sooti bo nadii mosikoi, endelo edii na mosikoi okina adii itina di bwela bonɔ mba. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Wɛɛ iyaya; puma ehuma, akapala boosikoa, aosikoe. Amiti pala, naodikanedji ta kombe Kumu o bomɔ, mbi mɛnɛ naosikoadea. Wɛɛ iyaya tii mbunoko ehuma.» <verse eid="RUT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Luta awɛɛ ta mako ma Boadji mbunoko ehuma endelo aimana na ihindihindi mɛnɛ. Modjɔ mo Boadji asabaleaka bo moto omɔti abwaniti nongo adjebe bo mwali iyo awɛɛki iya. <verse eid="RUT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Boadji abala na nde boso bo boyana bo: «Tingoa iputa di wɛ ko ipea na ngulu.» Luta anangodja iputa ko Boadji amopa katini dji olɔdje djisamano ko amobakea ta molo. Ngɔngɔ djimina ayana ta ngando enɛnɛ. <verse eid="RUT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Luta aimea ta dii bokiyo bo nde ko aso amowadja bo: «Mwana o mba, iho ko gala nda?» Iboa Luta amotubana midjɔ misusu mimokɔmea Boadji. <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Abala naikina bo: «Apini pongono katini idjidji djisamano dji olɔdje na bobala bo nitabɔngɔ nahule ta dii wɛ mabɔ mabae.» <verse eid="RUT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Naomi abala bo: «Mwana o mba o mwali, kanga molema tee mbunoko odjebe mondumba monɔmɔɔdea modjɔ momina. Modjɔ mo moomi iyona adikamadea bogo busa ibubu oko akamasidja modjɔ momina!»<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Boadji asapi na modjɔ moindji isango di Elimɛlɛki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Boadji akɛɛ adaa ta modipe mo ngando enɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Modipe mo ngando edaka esika e mohelo mo bato basusu: baputoanaka ena, babɔngedjaka mɛko iyana, bakataka pongono makambo ena.</char></note>. Ngɔngɔ dji moo ehole mokɛkɛ, mosikoi o ibota di Elimɛlɛkɛ iyona obalaka Boadji adoa anɔɔ ena. Boadji amobea: «Wɛ pete doa adae iya». Iyo aso adoa ko adaa na mobondo. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Iboa Boadji abea baami doomi ta tei e basuku ba ngando enɛnɛ badae na bu. Ibo baso badaa na mobondo. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Boadji awadja na mosikoi ibo: «Naomi ahuli ta ekomi e Moabi. Apalakadea atɛkise mokpɔtɔ mo mwange e biso Elimɛlɛkɛ. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Mbi nasepi nabale na wɛ modjɔ momina ko naotɔndee osombe mokpɔtɔ momina boso bo basuku ko na boso bo bato ibibi basusu badii iya edɛdiyeye. Okapala bosomba somba, emiti bɔngɔ tɔndea mbi, modjɔ mo ngɔngɔ dji wɛ edii mbi moto abwani botomba ikoki dimina.» Moomi omina asɔmbedja bo: «Napalakadea namosombe.» <verse eid="RUT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Boadji abala bo: «Busa bosombadea na wɛ mokpɔtɔ momina ta dii Naomi, otungi bosikoa pongono Luta moto o Moabi, mwali o mwange e biso ogwa obote na nde bɛngi mokpɔtɔ momina modikame mo muma nde o gwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Otungi boasɔ pongono Luta: ta mikanda miyou; mi Baebele osombadea pongono Luta. Ta molɔngɔ imu, boindja 2, 20 kona nase. </char></note>.» <verse eid="RUT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Mosikoi omina asɔmbedja bo: «Ekadaa iboa naloni, nitasikoakadea midjɔ mimina, nasaka bedja bodieli bo mbi. Wɛ mɛnɛ sikoa midjɔ mimina, modjɔ mo mbi nita hɔnɔ.»<verse eid="RUT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Ndelo ekina ta Isalɛlɛ, bɛngi basukedje modjɔ mosusu moindji bosomba eka emɔti kaoko bosandja eka emɔti ta polo e eka ekina, moto omɔti ta tei e bobo aiwaka sapato dji nde ko adjipaka ta dii okina bɛngi basukedje modjɔ. Ikambo dimina diinedjaka bo badhimeani. <verse eid="RUT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Ta tina emina ta ehole ebalaka mosikoi na Boadji asombe mokpɔtɔ, aiwa sapato dji nde ko aso amopa. <verse eid="RUT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Iboa, Boadji abala na basuku ko na bato basusu badaa ena bo: «Ino bɛnɛ odiini ba temo busa ibubu bo nasombi ta dii Naomi leka losusu lodaki lo Elimɛlɛkɛ, Kiliɔni na Mahalɔni. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Natombi pongono Luta moto o Moabi mwali o Malɔni ogwa. Namobotee bana ibia basangoadea bodieli bo nde, ibota di nde adae pɛpɛ bolɛmɔ ta tei e denga di nde kaoko ta ngando enɛnɛ e nde. Ino bɛnɛ odiini ba temo busa ibubu.» <verse eid="RUT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Basuku na bato ibia badaka ena babala bo: «Iso lodii batemo. Kina bo Kumu adjongoe mwali iyona osakwea ta ndako e wɛ; adae mondumba momɔti na Lasɛlɛ ko na Lea ibia babota bato ba Isalɛlɛ! Kina bo bodieli bo wɛ bodae bonɛnɛ ta ibota di Epalata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lasɛlɛ na Lea: bali babae ba Yakobo, boindja ta Mba 29, 11 botita nase. Epalata: boindja 1, 2 ko na nase.</char></note> ko kombe e wɛ edjebame ta Bɛtɛlɛlɛmɛ esusu! <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Kina bo Kumu aopɛ bana banɛnɛ na ndjea e moseka mwali ko ibota di wɛ didae ondingo ibota di Pelɛsi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pɛlɛsi adii kɔkɔ o Boadji, boindja ta 4, 18-21; 1Ko 2, 5.9-12.</char></note>, mwana o Yuda na Tamale!»<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Boadji asɔi Luta; bobotama bo Obɛdi, kɔkɔ e Dapiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Iboa Boadji atomba Luta ko aimea mwali o nde. Kumu amodjongoa alwa deemi ko aso abota mwana moomi. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Bali babala na Naomi bo: «Kumu asɔe ekumu! Iyo akiniti busa ibubu bo otake mosikoi. Kina bo kombe e nde edie gala ta isalɛlɛ! <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Asɔmbɔtɔnɔdea bomɔ bo wɛ ko aobaneadea ta ehole eimeadea wɛ mobange. Modjɔ mo bokiyo bo wɛ o mwali okaopale aboti mwana moomi, iyo anɔi kutu bana baami sambo.» <verse eid="RUT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Naomi atomba mwana amobakea ta bupa bo nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Naomi amobakea ta bupa bo nde: na pɛpɛ kitɛ edii embete isango, boɛngɛ Mba 30, 3-8; 48, 5-12; 50, 23.</char></note> ko aso amobɔkɔ. <verse eid="RUT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Bali badaka mbuti mbuti babala bo: «Babotei Naomi mwana moomi!» Bamobakea kombe e «Obɛdi». Obɛdi adaka sange Yisai iyona odaka sange e Dapiti.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Molɔngɔ mo motangi mo bakɔkɔ ba Dapiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Indja molɔngɔ mo motangi mo bakɔkɔ ba Dapiti bobanga ta dii Pelɛsi: Pɛlɛsi abota Hesolɔni, <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Hesolɔni abota Lama, Lama abota Aminadaba, <verse eid="RUT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Aminadaba abota Nasoni, Nasoni abota Salama, <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Salama abota Boadji ko Boadji abota Obɛdɛ, <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Obɛdɛ abota Yisai ko Yisai abota Dapiti.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>